    <description>Artificial bioferrite hormone-producing organs that can be sewn onto a spine. The morphogens they produce make the skeleton more resemblant of cartilage, enabling them to bend with blows instead of breaking, at the expense of making it more difficult to keep stable in the face of a heavy blow.\n\nDue to the extremely painful nature of the prosthetic, only ghouls can tolerate this enhancement.</description>
    <descriptionHyperlinks><RecipeDef>HVB_InstallCartilaginousSpine</RecipeDef></descriptionHyperlinks>
    <statBases>
      <Mass>0.3</Mass>
      <WorkToMake>13200</WorkToMake>
